  "text": "## Closure Scenarios  \n### Scenario 1: Standard Customer-Initiated Closure  \n```\nCustomer: Closes SmartSaver Account\n\nDay 1:\n- Customer calls 0800-555-2265\n- Requests closure, all balance to bank transfer\n- Provides receiving bank details\n- System notes closure request\n\nDay 2:\n- Operations processes request\n- Final balance calculated: £4,264.90\n- Payment initiated (FPS transfer)\n- Closure confirmation letter generated\n\nDay 3:\n- Customer receives bank transfer\n- Receives confirmation letter\n- Account status changed to \"Closed\"\n- Records archived\n\nResult: ✅ Closed in 3 days, customer satisfied\n```",
